🌙 **5 Arkaan-e-Islam (Five Pillars of Islam)**

Rasulullah ﷺ ne farmaya:
*"Islam ki buniyad paanch cheezon par hai:
1️⃣ Shahadat dena ke Allah ke siwa koi ma’bood nahi aur Muhammad ﷺ Allah ke Rasool hain,
2️⃣ Namaz qayam karna,
3️⃣ Zakat ada karna,
4️⃣ Roza rakhna Ramzan ka,
5️⃣ Hajj karna (agar qudrat ho)."*
(Bukhari & Muslim)

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

1️⃣ **Shahadah (Iman ka Aitiraaf)

**“La ilaha illallah Muhammadur Rasulullah.”**
👉 Yani: Allah ke siwa koi ilaah nahi, aur Muhammad ﷺ Allah ke Rasool hain.

📖 Qur’an se Daleel:

* *“Allah gawah hai ke uske siwa koi ma’bood nahi, aur farishte aur ilm walay bhi gawah hain ke woh insaaf par qayam hai. Uske siwa koi ma’bood nahi, wohi Ghalib aur Hakeem hai.”*
  (Surah Aal-e-Imran 3:18)

* *“Aur humne aap se pehle koi Rasool nahi bheja magar uski taraf wahi ki: Mere siwa koi ilaah nahi, pas meri ibadat karo.”*
  (Surah Al-Anbiya 21:25)

📜 Hadith:

* Rasulullah ﷺ ne farmaya:
  *"Jo shaks dil se Shahadat de ke Allah ke siwa koi ilaah nahi aur Muhammad ﷺ Allah ke Rasool hain, Allah usay Jahanum se bacha lega."*
  (Bukhari, Muslim)

✨ Ahmiyat:

* Shahadah **Islam ka pehla aur sabse buniyadi rukun** hai.
* Is se Musalman aur Ghair-Musalman mein tafreeq hoti hai.
* Ye Imaan aur Amal dono ki buniyad hai.

✅ Status: Mandatory aur Islam ki entry gate.

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________


2️⃣ **Salah (Namaz)**

👉 Din mein 5 waqt ki Namaz farz hai.

📖 Qur’an se Daleel:

* *“Namaz qayam karo, zakat do aur ruku karne walon ke saath ruku karo.”*
  (Surah Al-Baqarah 2:43)

* *“Beshak Namaz fahashi aur burai se rokti hai.”*
  (Surah Al-Ankabut 29:45)

📜 Hadith:

* Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya:
  *"Mere ummat ke liye sabse pehle jis cheez ka hisaab hoga Qayamat ke din, woh Namaz hai."*
  (Tirmidhi)

* Aur farmaya:
  *"Banday aur kufr/shirk ke darmiyan farq Namaz hai."*
  (Muslim)

✨ Ahmiyat:

* Namaz roohani ghiza hai.
* Musalman ka roz ka **direct connection Allah se** hai.
* Jo Namaz ko chhodta hai uske baare mein sakht wa’eed aayi hai.

✅ Status: Mandatory (Farz) — 5 waqt ka.

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

 3️⃣ **Zakat (Maal ki Saaf-safai aur Ghareebon ka Haq)**

👉 Apne maal ka ek hissa (2.5%) ghareebon, yatimon, aur mohtaajon ko dena.

📖 Qur’an se Daleel:

* *“Aur Namaz qayam karo, zakat do, aur jo neki tum aage bhejoge, Allah ke paas use paoge.”*
  (Surah Al-Baqarah 2:110)

* *“Zakat to sirf fuqara, masakeen, zakat kaam karne walon, jin ke dil jode jate hain, ghulamon ki azadi, qarzdar, Allah ke raaste aur musafir ke liye hai.”*
  (Surah At-Tawbah 9:60)

📜 Hadith:

* Rasulullah ﷺ ne farmaya:
  *"Jis ko Allah maal deta hai aur woh zakat nahi deta, to us maal ko Qayamat ke din aag ka saanp bana kar uske gale mein daala jayega."*
  (Bukhari)

* Ek aur hadith:
  *"Zakat maal ko kam nahi karti."*
  (Muslim)

✨ Ahmiyat:

* Zakat maal ko paak karti hai.
* Society mein insaf aur barabari ka nizaam banati hai.
* Ghurbat aur faqriyat ko kam karti hai.

✅ Status: Mandatory (agar nisab ho).

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________


4️⃣ **Sawm (Roza)**

👉 Ramzan ke mahine mein subah se shaam tak khana, peena aur shahwatiyat se rukna.

📖 Qur’an se Daleel:

* *“Ae Imaan walon! Tum par roza farz kiya gaya jaise tum se pehle logon par kiya gaya tha, taake tum parhezgar ban jao.”*
  (Surah Al-Baqarah 2:183)

* *“Ramzan ka mahina jis mein Qur’an nazil hua... Jo tum mein se is mahine ko paaye woh roza rakhe.”*
  (Surah Al-Baqarah 2:185)

📜 Hadith:

* Rasulullah ﷺ ne farmaya:
  *"Jo shaks Ramzan ke rozay imaan ke saath aur sawab ki niyyat se rakhe, uske pehle gunah maaf ho jate hain."*
  (Bukhari, Muslim)

* Ek aur hadith:
  *"Rozedaar ke mooh ki boo Allah ke nazdeek misk se bhi zyada pyari hai."*
  (Bukhari)

✨ Ahmiyat:

* Roza **taqwa paida karta hai**.
* Insaan ko sabr aur self-control sikhata hai.
* Roohaniyat ko mazboot aur dil ko naram banata hai.
✅ Status: Mandatory (sirf Ramzan ke dinon mein).

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

 5️⃣ **Hajj (Allah ke Ghar ka Safar)**

👉 Zindagi mein ek martaba Hajj farz hai jo qudrat aur istita’at rakhta ho.

 📖 Qur’an se Daleel:

* *“Aur Allah ke liye logon par Hajj farz hai us ghar ka, jo qudrat rakhta ho safar ki. Aur jo kufr kare, Allah duniya walon se be-niyaaz hai.”*
  (Surah Aal-e-Imran 3:97)

 📜 Hadith:

* Rasulullah ﷺ ne farmaya:
  *"Jo Hajj kare aur usme faasik aur badkirdgi se bache, woh paak ho kar laut ta hai jaise naya paida hua."*
  (Bukhari, Muslim)

* Ek aur hadith:
  *"Umrah se doosri Umrah tak ke darmiyan ke gunah maaf hote hain, aur maqbool Hajj ka sawaab jannat hai."*
  (Bukhari, Muslim)

 ✨ Ahmiyat:

* Hajj insaan ko duniya se kaat kar sirf Allah ke saamne khada karta hai.
* Sab Musalman barabar ho jaate hain — rang, mazhab, khandan sab khatam, sirf **Tawheed aur Ibadat** bachi rehti hai.

✅ Status: Mandatory (agar qudrat ho).

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌟 Nateeja

Ye paanch Arkaan Islam ke **buniyadi pillars** hain.
👉 Shahadah – Aqeedah
👉 Salah – Ibadat ka nizam
👉 Zakat – Maashiyat ki paaki
👉 Sawm – Nafas par control
👉 Hajj – Ummat ki wahdat aur Allah ki ibadat

Jis tarah bina sthambhon ke imaarat khadi nahi hoti, waise hi in paanch ke baghair Islam mukammal nahi hota.



